# Loaded by `vite build --mode test`, which is how the end-to-end build is
# made. A developer's own .env points the client at their local token server,
# and Vite loads that file for every build, so without this the demo tests
# would be built in community mode and would sit waiting for a channel list
# that a sign-in screen was never going to show. Empty means demo mode.
VITE_API_URL=
